Voice clips (public/assets/sounds/vulcan.mp3, shotgun.mp3, beam.mp3,
maxed.mp3, unlocked.mp3, upgraded.mp3)
  Synthetic speech generated with Google text-to-speech. No license is
  granted to reuse these files, to the extent any rights in them exist.

AI-generated art (sprites, backgrounds, cover and marketing images)
  Generated with Google Gemini (Nano Banana), with minor manual edits by
